Here's what a **production-grade, multi-marketplace, CRM-aware automation platform** looks like:

```
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│                     Frontend (React/Next.js)                    │
├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│  API Gateway (rate limit, auth, routing, request validation)    │
